{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id416925433"}, "name":{"label":"clineuiansen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-28T02:20:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.6.3"}, "id":{"label":"14602692170"}, "title":{"label":"Pay or leave"}, "content":{"label":"Any basic feature like repeat events and import your current calendar is behind a paywall. Looks a great app, but you can’t even do the basics without subscription.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id975351174"}, "name":{"label":"clarke735"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-28T10:45:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.3"}, "id":{"label":"14359289616"}, "title":{"label":"Works great for me as an autistic person!"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried several (paid) visual planning apps, and Structured is by far the best I’ve tried. Setting up tasks is easy, especially as the app remembers previous tasks. Planning the week on Structured feels like a self care step rather than another executive functioning task. The visual timers are simple and exactly what I need and Apple Watch integration is seamless. The energy tracking feature is a great addition I haven’t seen in other apps. I appreciate that while the app does have AI integration it is easily disabled and doesn’t impact functionality. As someone who needs a strong visual planner as a daily disability aid, I find Structured to be intuitive, calming, and amazing value for money.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id30047241"}, "name":{"label":"Lemon Lozenge"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-04T01:42:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.0"}, "id":{"label":"14142160075"}, "title":{"label":"Great aesthetic and features"}, "content":{"label":"Only had the app very briefly but for my use of ADHD management and keeping on top of daily tasks that I would otherwise forget, it’s fantastic. I would LOVE it if I could set up yearly tasks so that I can more easily remember birthdays which is one of the main draws to apps like these. I’m instituting a way around it by adding a note to recreate the task, but this could very easily be fixed within the app itself. Currently the longest duration for a repeating task is monthly.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id192791317"}, "name":{"label":"western1919"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-01T02:28:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.4"}, "id":{"label":"13801792403"}, "title":{"label":"Cannot search for an event is frustrating"}, "content":{"label":"I find it frustrating that I cannot find an event in the history with a word search. Also there are too many micro steps to create an event or reminder. At times I haven’t created the event as I’ve missed the final step.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
