{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id1741188893"}, "name":{"label":"Tomwise77"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-15T08:25:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"13019610630"}, "title":{"label":"Looks nice, but not too useful"}, "content":{"label":"This app is decent if you are able to strictly adhere to your envisioned schedule and not deviate from it. Should something get in the way of you working on your current task, it’s a pain to have to shift the whole day forward manually and adds extra friction to the UX. Not having past unfinished tasks displayed in the widget is also not great, as it kind of implies those tasks are no longer relevant and therefore need not to be displayed.\n\nHowever, I do want to give it some stars for looking pretty sleek, and having repeat tasks and reminders pretty customizable.\n\nAfter one year of usage (my Pro just expired), I just cancelled and am switching to Super Prod instead.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
